<meta name="description" content="Updated: April 2024 1. What records must committee management officers (CMOs) create or maintain? The CMO must keep records that include, but are not limited to: Charter and membership documentation Annual comprehensive review Agency guidelines Closed meeting determinations See 41 CFR 102-3.115 for more specific details. 2. What records should Designated Federal officers" />
